#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0045 expect=noViolation domain=ADAE
#note "PLAN-engine-fixture-join-key-drift: ported from cumba-corej CdiscAd0044And0045IntegrationTest.cdiscAd0045_matchingDatePart_noViolation. Numeric SAS values, the ADaM shape: ASTDTM 86400 is day 1 (1960-01-02T00:00:00), ASTDT 1 is day 1 (1960-01-02) -> the date part matches -> no violation. The invalid sibling differs only in ASTDT."
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ASTDTM  type=Num format=DATETIME20.
col ASTDT   type=Num format=DATE9.
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 86400 | 1
